- op: discuss  # dbbb
  at: '2026-05-27T17:05:27Z'  # dbbb
  by: agent  # dbbb
  actor: jgstern_agent  # dbbb
  clock: 3  # dbbb
  nonce: dbbb  # dbbb
  message: "Fixed in PR #3934. Root cause: 11 analyzers constructed AnalysisRun(...) directly bypassing the create() factory, leaving config_fingerprint as empty string. Fix: __post_init__ auto-defaults empty config_fingerprint to _default_config_fingerprint() (sha256 hash of empty config). Structural — covers all current and future direct constructions."  # dbbb
